sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Trader
    participant CD as CyberDeltaEngine
    participant ML as ML Module
    participant FRS as Funding Rate Strategy
    participant BP as Backpack API (CEX)
    participant HL as Hyperliquid API (DEX)
    participant PX as Paradex API (DEX)
    participant RM as Risk Management

    Note over CD,RM: Initialization Phase
    User->>CD: Initialize trading bot (Funding Rate Strategy)
    CD->>FRS: Initialize funding rate parameters
    CD->>ML: Load & activate ML models (E[FR], σ_mkt, C_target)
    ML-->>RM: Predict initial σ_mkt & E[FR] for risk limits
    RM->>RM: Set dynamic limits: VaR_t = α * σ_mkt * PV_t
    Note right of RM: ML forecasts market volatility

    Note over CD,PX: Data Collection & Validation Phase
    loop Every t seconds
        par Fetch CEX Data
            CD->>BP: Fetch prices, funding rates, depth, sentiment
            BP-->>CD: Backpack Market Data
        and Fetch DEX Data (Hyperliquid)
            CD->>HL: Fetch prices, funding rates, depth, sentiment
            HL-->>CD: Hyperliquid Market Data
        and Fetch DEX Data (Paradex)
            CD->>PX: Fetch prices, funding rates, depth, sentiment
            PX-->>CD: Paradex Market Data
        end
        CD->>ML: Detect anomalies (e.g., z-score > 3) & impute gaps
        ML-->>CD: Cleaned data + quality score (Q_t)
    end

    Note over CD,RM: Analysis Phase
    CD->>FRS: Process validated data
    FRS->>ML: Predict E[FR_t] = μ_FR + ε_t, σ_B,t = f(Features_t)
    ML-->>FRS: Forecasts (E[FR_t], σ_B,t, confidence)
    FRS->>FRS: Compute π^X_t = E[FR_t] - C^X_t
    FRS->>FRS: Compute π^{AB}_t = E[FR^A_t - FR^B_t] - C^{AB}_t
    FRS->>ML: Cluster opportunities by risk/return profile
    ML-->>FRS: Clustered signals (e.g., K-means groups)
    FRS-->>CD: Enhanced arbitrage signals
    CD->>RM: Optimize sizing: w_t = (π_t / σ_t^2) * α_t
    RM->>ML: Predict correlation shifts (Σ_t)
    ML-->>RM: Updated Σ_t for risk: √w_t^T Σ_t w_t
    RM-->>CD: Position weights (w_t)

    Note over CD,RM: Collateral Check / Rebalancing Phase
    RM->>ML: Predict C_target_t = E[C_needed_t] + k * σ_C_t
    ML-->>RM: C_target^BP, C_target^HL, C_target^PX
    RM->>BP: Compare C_current^BP vs C_target^BP
    RM->>HL: Compare C_current^HL vs C_target^HL
    RM->>PX: Compare C_current^PX vs C_target^PX
    alt Rebalancing Needed
        RM->>ML: Predict transfer cost (TC_t) & latency (L_t)
        ML-->>RM: TC_t, L_t, optimal path (e.g., BP → HL)
        RM->>BP: Initiate transfer (e.g., USDC)
        RM->>HL: Receive transfer (on-chain confirmation)
    end

    Note over CD,User: Decision & Execution Phase
    CD->>ML: Predict regime (e.g., P(VolSpike_t) via HMM)
    ML-->>CD: Regime probs (e.g., P(VolSpike_t) = 0.75)
    CD->>CD: Adjust timing if P(VolSpike_t) > 0.7
    alt Single-Exchange Arbitrage
        CD->>HL: Execute delta-neutral (Long Perp + Hedge)
    else Cross-Exchange Arbitrage
        CD->>BP: Execute Leg 1 (Short Perp)
        CD->>HL: Execute Leg 2 (Long Perp, FOK)
    end
    CD->>RM: Update positions & risk metrics

    Note over CD,User: Monitoring & Adaptation Phase
    loop Every funding period
        par Collect Funding
            CD->>BP: Receive funding payments
            BP-->>CD: Funding data
            CD->>HL: Receive funding payments
            HL-->>CD: Funding data
            CD->>PX: Receive funding payments
            PX-->>CD: Funding data
        end
        CD->>ML: Analyze PnL_t, Yield_t, σ_P_t
        ML-->>CD: Performance metrics + drift alerts
    end
    loop Real-Time Adaptation
        CD->>ML: Reinforcement Learning: Update α_t = α_{t-1} + η * ∇Q_t
        ML-->>FRS: Optimized α_t for Kelly sizing
        FRS->>RM: Adjust w_t based on α_t & σ_B,t
    end
    CD->>User: Report PnL_t, Yield_t, VaR_t